OL,3,GNEWSA'Words cannot describe losing our
OL,4,Ahome in Stourbridge wildfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobin and Loxie Williams have lived at
OL,7,Fthe four-bedroom house, on Ounty John
OL,8,FLane, in Stourbridge, for 26 years.
OL,10,FThey had been out with friends last
OL,11,FThursday but when they returned home
OL,12,Ftheir road had been shut by
OL,13,Ffirefighters.
OL,15,FNow, their remaining posessions include
OL,16,Fa teacup, some paperwork and a few
OL,17,Fitems of burnt clothing left from a
OL,18,Fpile of ironing in the kitchen.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
