OL,3,GNEWSA'Words cannot describe losing our
OL,4,Ahome in Stourbridge wildfire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurveying the wreckage of their home,
OL,7,Fthey told the BBC that on their return
OL,8,Fthat Thursday evening they were forced
OL,9,Fto watch their neighbourhood going up
OL,10,Fin flames on TV.
